Z||000020||DXR_DAD||01-28-2000||12:42 AM||||William did you read the installation on DaRkLoRd's web site? <BR>It is a easy installation it will fit ANY FIERO. And it is one of the best mods you can do to get the heat out of the engine compartment any thing that you can do to lower the temp is a big help. I tell everyone get one!!! it's worth it.IMHO  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
